<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#hasStart> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "hasStart" .
<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#hasStart> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Het starttijdstip van het alarm."@nl .
<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#hasStart> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The start time of the alarm."@en .
