# http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#Metric
<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#Metric> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#Metric> <http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#nodeKind> <http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#Stateful> .
<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#Metric> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "Metric" .
<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#Metric> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A measurable quantity, computed from one or more signals by a mda:SignalAnalysis step."@en .
<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#Metric> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Een meetbare grootheid, berekend uit één of meer signalen door een mda:SignalAnalysis-stap."@nl .
<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#Metric> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Metric"@en .
<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#Metric> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Metriek"@nl .
