<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#TherapeuticModality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A therapeutic intervention or treatment modality."@en .
<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#TherapeuticModality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Een therapeutische interventie of behandelingsmodaliteit."@nl .
<http://example.org/model-device-alarm-knowledge#TherapeuticModality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Therapeutic Modality"@en .
